    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You know the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMending000]{Mending} cantrip.</p><p>As a Magic action while holding Tinker's Tools, you can create one item in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of you, chosen from the following list: Ball Bearings, Basket, Bedroll, Bell, Blanket, Block and Tackle, Bottle (Glass), Bucket, Caltrops, Candle, Crowbar, Flask, Grappling Hook, Hunting Trap, Jug, Lamp, Manacles, Net, Oil, Paper, Parchment, Pole, Pouch, Rope, Sack, Shovel, Spikes (Iron), String, Tinderbox, Torch, or Vial. The item follows its rules in the Player's Handbook and lasts until you finish a Long Rest, when it vanishes.</p><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-A7eePW3A8ZEGSCEh\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Drop the chosen item from the equipment compendium; delete it after your next Long Rest.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
